  {
   "id": 1136607,
   "title": "Belt tensioning",
   "updated": "2026-08-18 07:46:15",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "This chapter will guide you through calibrating and preparing the printer for its first run. Starting with tensioning the belts:",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The left screw adjusts the upper belt.",
     "color": "orange",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The right screw adjusts the lower belt.",
     "color": "violet",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>WARNING: Incorrect procedure may result in damage to plastic parts or seizing of screws. Before adjusting the belt tension, read the dedicated article:</strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "caution",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong><a href=\"http://help.prusa3d.com/article/adjusting-belt-tension-core-one-core-one-indx-core-one-l_845048\">Adjusting belt tension (CORE One)</a></strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "Do not forget to come back here after adjusting the belts.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "reminder",
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
    {
     "original": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eed4544c534bc36d.jpg",
     "large": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eed4544c534bc36d-800x600.jpg",
     "srcset": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eed4544c534bc36d-533x400.jpg 533w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eed4544c534bc36d-800x600.jpg 800w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eed4544c534bc36d-300x225.jpg 300w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eed4544c534bc36d-768x576.jpg 768w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eed4544c534bc36d-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eed4544c534bc36d.jpg 1600w"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 1136439,
   "title": "Firmware Download",
   "updated": "2026-07-23 13:14:11",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "We will have to upgrade the firmware.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The CORE One+ requires firmware version 6.4.0 or newer.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "Visit the <a href=\"https://help.prusa3d.com/product/core-one-plus\"> CORE One+ support page on help.prusa3d.com</a>.",
     "color": "green",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Download the latest firmware file (.bbf).<br />Save the file onto a USB drive.",
     "color": "blue",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
